Thumbs.db
# AppleDouble sidecars. macOS writes one of these beside every file when the
# volume cannot hold a resource fork itself — copying this tree through exFAT or
# a network share leaves a ._<name> next to every real name, including inside
# .git. They carry nothing this project needs.
._*

